// ---------------------------------------------------------------- Shinjuku Sumitomo Building (210 m, 52 F, 1974) + Triangle Square (2020)
// The triangle with cut corners (OSM footprint) round a full-height triangular atrium (glass roof at the top), a fine aluminium window
